maries","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":624.18},{"type":"text","id":"t24f","name":"Paste your meeting notes into an AI mode","content":"Paste your meeting notes into an AI model and get clean, actionable summaries with key decisions and next steps highlighted.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":668.98},{"type":"text","id":"t24g","name":"3. Research Synthesis","content":"3. Research Synthesis","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":766.57},{"type":"text","id":"t24h","name":"Need to understand a complex topic quick","content":"Need to understand a complex topic quickly? Paste in your notes, articles or reports and AI can condense them into a clear summary in seconds.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":811.37},{"type":"text","id":"t24i","name":"4. Code Review","content":"4. Code Review","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":908.96},{"type":"text","id":"t24j","name":"Whether you’re a developer or just learn","content":"Whether you’re a developer or just learning, AI can review your code, spot bugs, suggest improvements, and explain complex patterns.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":953.76},{"type":"text","id":"t24k","name":"5. Content Repurposing","content":"5. Content Repurposing","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1051.35},{"type":"text","id":"t24l","name":"Turn a blog post into social media posts","content":"Turn a blog post into social media posts, a newsletter, or a presentation outline. AI can adapt your content for any format or platform.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":1096.15},{"type":"text","id":"t24m","name":"6. Data Analysis","content":"6. Data Analysis","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1193.74},{"type":"text","id":"t24n","name":"Drop your data into an AI model and ask ","content":"Drop your data into an AI model and ask questions in plain language. Get insights without writing a single line of SQL or Python.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":1238.54},{"type":"text","id":"t24o","name":"7. Language Translation","content":"7. Language Translation","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1336.13},{"type":"text","id":"t24p","name":"AI models handle nuanced translations fa","content":"AI models handle nuanced translations far better than simple translation tools, preserving tone, context, and cultural references.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":336,"y":1380.9