ng.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":3273.55},{"type":"text","id":"t2x1","name":"How Hustlrr.ai Fits In","content":"How Hustlrr.ai Fits In","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":20,"y":3399.94},{"type":"text","id":"t2x2","name":"While AI tools are powerful, they can so","content":"While AI tools are powerful, they can sometimes feel scattered. You’re switching between tools, copying and pasting, trying to piece together insights.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":3444.74},{"type":"text","id":"t2x3","name":"This is where Hustlrr.ai comes in. It’s ","content":"This is where Hustlrr.ai comes in. It’s designed to help you streamline your idea validation process by integrating the best of AI tools into a single, easy-to-use interface. You can ask Hustlrr to evaluate your idea, generate a report, and even suggest next steps—all without leaving the app.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":3579.93},{"type":"text","id":"t2x4","name":"It’s not about replacing AI tools, but a","content":"It’s not about replacing AI tools, but about making them work better together.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":3801.51},{"type":"text","id":"t2x5","name":"Final Thoughts","content":"Final Thoughts","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":20,"y":3899.1},{"type":"text","id":"t2x6","name":"AI is not a magic bullet, but it’s a pow","content":"AI is not a magic bullet, but it’s a powerful ally in the early stages of your startup journey. It can help you avoid costly mistakes, gain clarity, and speed up the validation process.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":3943.9},{"type":"text","id":"t2x7","name":"If you’re thinking about launching a new","content":"If you’re thinking about launching a new idea, don’t skip the validation step. Use AI tools to test your assumptions and get feedback before you invest everything.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":4079.08},{"type":"text","id":"t2x8","name":"And if you want to make that process eve","content":"And if you want to make that process even easier, try Hustlrr.ai. It’s built for founders who want to validate fast and move forward with confidence.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":20,"y":4214.27},{"type":"text","id":"t2x9","name":"👉","content":"👉","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":20,"y":4349.46},{"type":"text","id":"t2xa","name":"Start validating your ideas with Hustlrr","content":"Start validating your ideas with Hustlrr.ai","fill":"$accent","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","underline"