 cost of failure can be devastating.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":33,"y":428.99},{"type":"text","id":"t32q","name":"But what if there was a way to test your","content":"But what if there was a way to test your idea quickly, cheaply, and with minimal risk? Enter AI.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":535.38},{"type":"text","id":"t32r","name":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini ar","content":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini are increasingly being used by founders to validate their business concepts before diving in headfirst. These tools can help you identify flaws, assess market demand, and even draft your first product roadmap—all in a matter of minutes.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":33,"y":584.18},{"type":"text","id":"t32s","name":"Why Idea Validation Matters","content":"Why Idea Validation Matters","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":710.57},{"type":"text","id":"t32t","name":"Before you invest your time, energy, and","content":"Before you invest your time, energy, and money into a business idea, it’s crucial to validate it. This means answering questions like:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":33,"y":755.37},{"type":"text","id":"t32u","name":"Is there a real demand for this?","content":"Is there a real demand for this?","fill":"$text-secondary","fon