"content":"Here’s a quick breakdown of how each tool can help:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":1485.71},{"type":"text","id":"t338","name":"GPT","content":"GPT","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":1546.51},{"type":"text","id":"t339","name":"GPT is great for brainstorming, outlinin","content":"GPT is great for brainstorming, outlining, and writing. It can help you write a compelling pitch deck, draft a product description, or even simulate a customer interview.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":33,"y":1587.3},{"type":"text","id":"t33a","name":"Claude","content":"Claude","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":1676.9},{"type":"text","id":"t33b","name":"Claude excels at reasoning and complex a","content":"Claude excels at reasoning and complex analysis. It’s particularly useful for evaluating business models, identifying risks, and structuring detailed reports.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":768.5,"x":33,"y":1717.69},{"type":"text","id":"t33c","name":"Gemini","content":"Gemini","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":33,"y":1807.29},{"type":"text","id":"t33d","name":"Gemini is powerful for data analysis and","content":"Gemini is powerful for data analysis and synthesis. It can help you compare market trends, analy